          </h3>
          <CodeBlock
            lang="python"
            title="settings.py — Configuración de TokenAuthentication"
            code={`INSTALLED_APPS = [
    'django.contrib.admin',
    'django.contrib.auth',
    'django.contrib.contenttypes',
    'django.contrib.sessions',
    'django.contrib.messages',
    'django.contrib.staticfiles',
    'core',
    'rest_framework',
    'rest_api',
    'rest_framework.authtoken',  # 👈 1. Habilita la tabla de Tokens
]

# 2. Define TokenAuthentication como esquema de autenticación de la API
REST_FRAMEWORK = {
    'DEFAULT_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES': [
        'rest_framework.authentication.TokenAuthentication',
    ],
}`}
          />
        </div>

        <div>
